;. /create_document_flow
  ;@ /flow/definition create_document
  ;= Create a document from an explicit source proposal
    Use author_document or an authored native record for proposal. Select the
    existing Create document or Create child document control. Native admission
    checks the receiver, unused name, source and current guards. No publication
    happens here. Use retain_result to retain the resulting action receipts.

    ;@ /flow/input proposal
    ;= Native name and source fields
    ;@ /flow/input selection
    ;= Captured declared creation control
    ;@ /flow/step arguments ;/0x11/gov/flows/operations/stages/document_arguments
    ;@ /flow/bind proposal proposal
    ;= Select actual authoring arguments
    ;@ /flow/invoke actions ;/0x11/app/nenex/w/prepare_action_flow/flows/prepare_action
    ;@ /flow/bind selection selection
    ;@ /flow/bind arguments arguments
    ;= Preserve selection and rich source encoding
    ;@ /flow/invoke receipts ;/0x11/app/nenex/w/invoke_action_flow/flows/invoke_action
    ;@ /flow/bind actions actions
    ;= Create through native admission
    ;@ /flow/result receipts
    ;= Native document creation receipts
